      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, our firm is looking to move away from SMS-based MFA because of the interception risks. Can you put together a step-by-step guide for us to implement hardware security keys (like Yubikeys) instead? We need to know the deployment process and how to handle the onboarding for our staff.",
